{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Midnight Billiards</strong> is a <strong>turn-based</strong> <strong>roguelite</strong> game inspired by <i>Peglin</i> and billiards. Your goal is to bounce\u00a0 the ball\u00a0strategically  across the pool, triggering various post effects along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each game, you\u2019ll collect various items to deck-build your own unique playstyle. Spend your money in the shop to purchase items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter all kinds of characters and mini-challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimately, you\u2019ll face the boss of the building and strive to become the King of Midnight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rotate and Shoot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/rotate_hit.gif?t=1745510574\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Various Pool Tables for Various PlayStyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/pools.gif?t=1745510574\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect Items and Deck-build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/shop.gif?t=1745510574\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying impact effects for an exciting gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of selectable characters, each with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different customizable pool for various playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of unique items to mix and match for endless combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High replayability with procedurally generated maps to challenge your skills.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546480?t=1745510574","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546480?t=1745510574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/bb8475bcc01d00999b223128bebea3da71036370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745510574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/bb8475bcc01d00999b223128bebea3da71036370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745510574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Midnight Billiards</strong> is a <strong>turn-based</strong> <strong>roguelite</strong> game inspired by <i>Peglin</i> and billiards. Your goal is to bounce\u00a0 the ball\u00a0strategically  across the pool, triggering various post effects along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each game, you\u2019ll collect various items to deck-build your own unique playstyle. Spend your money in the shop to purchase items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter all kinds of characters and mini-challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimately, you\u2019ll face the boss of the building and strive to become the King of Midnight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rotate and Shoot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/rotate_hit.gif?t=1745510574\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Various Pool Tables for Various PlayStyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/pools.gif?t=1745510574\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect Items and Deck-build</strong></h2><p cla